From 34afaf9c0c36f1ba8645d483ea4752cfc4a391e8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alan Clucas <alan@clucas.org>
Date: Wed, 11 Mar 2026 10:08:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Merge commit from fork

The informer-based caching introduced in f22ae3b87 bypassed caller
authorization checks when reading templates.
This adds explicit auth.CanI() checks before returning data from the
informer cache, ensuring proper authorization while preserving
performance benefits.

Signed-off-by: Alan Clucas <alan@clucas.org>
---
